     A* Positional column boundaries for a DDS display file.
     A* Member: DSPCOL   Compilable: yes (CRTDSPF)
     A* Source: IBM i 7.5 DDS for display files
     A*   ibm.com/docs/en/i/7.5?topic=files-dds-display
     A* Retrieved: 2026-07-25
     A*
     A* col 17 name type. R record format, H help specification.
00010A          R CUSTMAINT                 TEXT('Customer maintenance')
     A* cols 30-34 length, 35 data type, 36-37 decimals, 38 usage,
     A* 39-41 line, 42-44 position.
00020A            CUSTNO         6S 0I  3 10
00030A            CUSTNAME      30A  B  4 10
00040A            BALANCE        9S 2O  5 10
00050A            HIDDENFLD     10A  H
00060A            MSGFLD        70A  M 24  2
00070A            PGMTOSYS      10A  P
     A* data types valid in column 35 for a display file
00080A            CHARFLD       10A  B  7  2
00090A            DATEFLD       10L  B  8  2
00100A            TIMEFLD        8T  B  9  2
00110A            TSFLD         26Z  O 10  2
00120A            FLOATFLD       8F  O 11  2
00130A            SIGNEDFLD      7S 2B 12  2
00140A            NUMONLY        5Y 0B 13  2
00150A            INHIBITED      5I  O 14  2
00160A            DIGITSONLY     5D  B 15  2
00170A            NUMCHAR        5M  B 16  2
00180A            NUMSHIFT       5N  B 17  2
00190A            ALPHAONLY      5X  B 18  2
00200A            KATAKANA       5W  B 19  2
     A* col 29 R draws the field from the referenced file
00210A                                      REF(REFLIB/REFFILE)
00220A            REFCUST   R        B 20  2
     A* cols 7-16 conditioning indicators, col 7 A/O to AND/OR them
00230A  01                             21  2'Conditioned constant'
00240A N02                                  DSPATR(HI)
00250AA 03 04N05                            DSPATR(RI)
00260AO 06                                  DSPATR(BL)
     A* IBM i names may contain #, $, @ and digits. A digit inside a
     A* name is not a numeric constant, and a name is not a keyword.
09400A            #CBX#3         5A  B 22  2
09410A            FLD2024        5A  B 22 10
09420A            ABCDEFGHIJ     5A  B 22 20
     A* Numeric literals in the functions area still scope.
09430A                                      CF03(03 'EXIT')
